格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Vision bridge plugin for DeepSeek Harness (dsh): image understanding for text-only models via luma-mcp, free Qwen3-VL-Flash by default.","id":"gh:1334922966","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-free-vision","slug":"FuzzySoul/dsh-free-vision","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","free","image-understanding","vision"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Vision bridge plugin for DeepSeek Harness (dsh): image understanding for text-only models via luma-m"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"cp, free Qwen3-VL-Flash by default."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-free-vision\n🌐 English | 中文"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**DSH 免费视觉插件** — 让纯文本模型获得看图能力（截图、报错、UI 分析、OCR、文档），优先使用各平台**免费视觉模型**，零 MCP 配置。"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**Free vision plugin for DeepSeek Harness (dsh)** — image understanding for text-only models using f"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ree-tier vision models, with zero MCP configuration."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## 为什么免费 / Why free"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"默认使用免费额度充足的提供商，无账单惊吓："},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| 提供商 | 模型 | 免费额度 | API Key 环境变量 |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| **qwen**（默认） | Qwen3-VL-Flash | 阿里云百炼限免（激活送 50万 token） | `DASHSCOPE_API_KEY` |\n| **volcengine** | "},{"id":"p8s2","text":"豆包视觉模型 | 火山引擎豆包免费 token（20万起，可申请 50万） | `VOLCENGINE_API_KEY` |\n| **siliconflow** | DeepSeek-OCR | 硅基"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"流动 OCR 免费 | `SILICONFLOW_API_KEY` |\n| zhipu | GLM-4.6V | 按量 | `ZHIPU_API_KEY` |\n| hunyuan | HY-Visio"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"n | 按量 | `HUNYUAN_API_KEY` |\n| custom | 任意 OpenAI 兼容 | — | `CUSTOM_API_KEY` + `CUSTOM_BASE_URL` + `C"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"PI_KEY` |\n| custom | 任意 OpenAI 兼容 | — | `CUSTOM_API_KEY` + `CUSTOM_BASE_URL` + `CUSTOM_MODEL_NAME` |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"一张 1MB 截图 ≈ 2600 token，qwen 限免额度可分析约 19 万张图。\nOne 1MB screenshot ≈ 2,600 tokens ≈ **$0.0006** on qwen"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"; free quota covers ~190,000 images."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## 特性 / Features"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- **零 MCP 配置** — 不用改 `cordis.patch.yml`、运行时不用 `npx`：视觉引擎（luma-mcp）作为本包依赖内置，进程内启动\n- **单个通用工具** — `ima"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"ge_understand`（可用 `config.toolName` 改名）注册到 `ctx.tools`，每次请求模型都能看到\n- **免费优先、多提供商** — 千问 / 豆包 / 硅基流动免费"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"档开箱即用；智谱 / 混元 / custom 可切换\n- **每个 Provider 可覆盖 API Base URL** — 内置 Provider 可指向代理、API Gateway、本地服务或任"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"意 OpenAI 兼容端点，无需改成 custom\n- **直连** — 子进程剥离代理环境变量，国内 API 直连（带代理会导致 502）\n- **任务模式** — `auto | general "},{"id":"p11s5","text":"| ocr | ui | debug | describe`；大图自动多裁剪保真\n- **中英双语** — 工具描述与文档中英文都可用"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## 安装 / Install"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"重启 `dsh web` 后，工具 `image_understand` 即可用。\nRestart `dsh web`; the tool appears as `image_understand`."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## 设置界面 / Settings UI"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"重启 dsh web 后，打开 **设置 → Free Vision** 即可看到配置表单（API Key、提供商、\n工具名等），由插件 schema 自动渲染。保存到 `~/.dsh/free-vi"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"sion.json`，下一次\n调用立即生效，无需重启。"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"After restart, open **Settings → Free Vision** — a form for every config option,\nsaved to `~/.dsh/fr"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"ee-vision.json`, effective on the next tool call."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## 配置 / Configuration"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"也可以只设置对应的环境变量（如 `DASHSCOPE_API_KEY`）。\nOr just set the matching environment variable (e.g. `DASHSCOPE"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"变量（如 `DASHSCOPE_API_KEY`）。\nOr just set the matching environment variable (e.g. `DASHSCOPE_API_KEY`)."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### 覆盖 API 地址 / Base URL override"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"当 `baseURLs` 缺失或值为空时，继续使用该 Provider 的官方默认地址。"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| Provider | 默认 Base URL |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| qwen | `https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1` |\n| volcengine | `https://ark.cn-beijin"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"g.volces.com/api/v3` |\n| siliconflow | `https://api.siliconflow.cn/v1` |\n| zhipu | `https://open.big"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"model.cn/api/paas/v4` |\n| hunyuan | `https://api.hunyuan.cloud.tencent.com/v1` |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"引擎会自动拼接 `/chat/completions` 并避免重复路径，因此以下写法都可用："},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- `https://my-proxy.example.com/v1`\n- `https://my-proxy.example.com/v1/chat/completions`"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"也可以使用环境变量：`QWEN_BASE_URL`、`VOLCENGINE_BASE_URL`、\n`SILICONFLOW_BASE_URL`、`ZHIPU_BASE_URL`、`HUNYUAN_BA"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"SE_URL`\n（以及 custom 的 `CUSTOM_BASE_URL`）。"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"### 免费 Key 申请 / Free API keys"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| 提供商 | 免费 Key 获取 |"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| qwen | 阿里云百炼 bailian.console.aliyun.com — 开通即送免费额度，模型选 qwen3-vl-flash（限免） |\n| volcengine | 火山引擎 vo"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"lcengine.com — 豆包新用户送免费 token（20万起，可申请 50万） |\n| siliconflow | 硅基流动 siliconflow.cn — DeepSeek-OCR 免费调"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"ngine.com — 豆包新用户送免费 token（20万起，可申请 50万） |\n| siliconflow | 硅基流动 siliconflow.cn — DeepSeek-OCR 免费调用 |"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## 用法 / Usage"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"模型调用 `image_understand` 时传入："},{"id":"p33s1","text":"- `image_source`（必填）：本地路径、HTTP(S) URL 或 data URI（PNG/JPG/WebP/GIF，≤10MB）\n- `prompt`（必填）：对图片的问题 — 中英文"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"均可\n- `task_type`（可选）：`auto | general | ocr | ui | debug | describe`"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## 工作原理 / How it works"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## 开发 / Development"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## 许可证 / License"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"MIT — 封装 luma-mcp（MIT）与 MCP SDK（MIT）。免费额度数据来自各平台官方页面，可能变动，使用前请核实。"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
